      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SHE'S PEAKIN' (1) has a fair record and proved too strong last time to win by 3.5 lengths at Murray Bridge in a handy 39.64 beating Weblec Polly. Ran the fastest time on the program in her latest win. Has hit winning form and can go on with it. MESSINA MISS (8) ran below her best last time finishing fifth (31.37) over 530m at Angle Park in a Special conditions race. Solid record here winning three races. Can figure in the finish. CANYA DIVERSION (2) goes very well this trip starting five times for two wins and two minors. Missed the frame latest (25.98) when seventh over 455m at Murray Bridge in a Grade 5. Looks well placed here and among the chances. OUR BEAVER (6) returns here as an each-way chance.",
